WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Emulator demonstration. Battery readings are supplied by Android test commands.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
User starts a charging session; the ongoing monitoring notification is shown.

00:11.000 --> 00:18.000
Screen off. The test battery reading reaches the 80% target.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.000
On wake, the 80% target notification is visible.

00:26.000 --> 00:34.000
The test unplug event ends the foreground monitoring session.
